  "_sText": "As if the Half Life customization community really needs another m4 to replace the 9mmAR...\r\nComes with optional choices of improved Half Life or Opposing Force arms and Gearbox's or Strykerwolf's animations. The HEV arms are compiled on H4wk's skin by default but they can be easily switched out.\r\n<b>WARNING: Due to severely massive amounts of polygons and textures, this model is recommended for high-end systems only.</b>\r\n\r\nModel: Soul_Slayer\r\n  Aimpoint: HellSpike\r\n  M203: Twinke Masta\r\nSkin: Thanez\r\n  Aimpoint Skin: Thanez\r\n  M203 Skin: Twinke Masta\r\n  Texture Chopping: HellSpike\r\nAnimations: Gearbox/Valve, Strykerwolf(ported by End of Days, edited by World Crafter)\r\nSounds: Vunsunta\r\nOriginal Base Compile: Sober\r\nCOmpile/Hack: World Crafter",
